* Voltage-mode buck 5 V to 3.3 V at 500 kHz, triangle carrier, smooth switch so both edges span several time steps,
* integrator compensation. Averaged twin: vm_buck_averaged.net
Vin vin 0 5
Vref ref 0 0.6
Vramp ramp 0 PULSE(0 2.5 0 1.4u 0.6u 0 2u)
Bsw sw 0 V=V(vin)*(0.5+0.5*tanh(5*(V(comp)-V(ramp))))
L1 sw out 1u Rser=10m
C1 out 0 10u Rser=10m
Rload out 0 1
Rtop out fb 10k
Rbot fb 0 2.22k
G1 0 comp ref fb 1m
Cc comp 0 11.6n
Ro comp 0 10meg
.tran 0 1m 0 40n startup
.end
